Andrew: You've completed your Fusion training! Not bad.

Andrew: Now that you've learned how Atomons use Compound Skills during Fusion, let's try something different.

Player:  What are we doing next?

Andrew: You'll learn how to craft your very own Atomon.

Player: Craft an Atomon? How?

Andrew: Crafting requires materials. You'll need protons, electrons, neutrons, and an Atomic Core.

Andrew: The amount of each material you need depends on the element you want to create.

Player: So I need to gather the materials before I can craft one?

Andrew: Exactly! Head to the crafting station and try creating an Atomon of your choice.

Andrew: I won't tell you which element to create. Choose one yourself and see what you can make.

Andrew: Once you've successfully crafted your first Atomon, come back here. I want to see what you've created!

